## Definition of done

- No hand-edits under `generated/`; behavior matches **packages** API + models.
- Auth/mutator untouched unless approved; server state in Query.
- Page DoD per `page-architecture.mdc`; CURRENT-STATE; AZES headers.
- **i18n complete** en+az+ru; no hardcoded user-facing strings.
- Scoped gates; **no** full-repo build / git / deploy.
- Final message = Agent Report + locale paths.
